	(gr_text "FABRICATION NOTES (JLCPCB)\n1. 2 layers, FR-4, 1.6 mm, board 68 x 54 mm, 2 mm corner radius.\n2. Outer copper: 2 oz recommended (1 oz minimum). HASL finish.\n3. All parts through-hole on the top side. 4x M3 holes, 3.2 mm, unplated.\n4. F1 uses plated slots 1.0 x 6.0 mm.\n5. Rules entered in Board Setup + ZVSDriver.kicad_dru:\n   track/gap >= 0.2 mm, via >= 0.6/0.3 mm, PTH ring >= 0.25 mm,\n   hole-to-hole >= 0.5 mm, copper-to-edge >= 0.3 mm, silk text >= 1.0/0.15 mm."
		(at 100 120 0)
		(layer "Cmts.User")
		(uuid "64ce1d51-5881-422c-b053-db3ba6d24d11")
		(effects
